#: frontend/templates/cheque-fraud.html:5
msgid "How to Spot and Avoid Cheque Scams – HSBC HK"
msgstr "如何避免支票詐騙陷阱 - 香港滙豐"

#: frontend/templates/cheque-fraud.html:11
msgid "How to Spot and Avoid Cheque Scams"
msgstr "如何避免支票詐騙陷阱"

#: frontend/templates/cheque-fraud.html:13
msgid "Cyber security &amp; fraud hub"
msgstr "網路安全及防詐騙資訊中心"

#: frontend/templates/cheque-fraud.html:18
msgid "Ledger balance vs available balance"
msgstr "賬面結餘vs可用結餘"

#: frontend/templates/cheque-fraud.html:19
msgid ""
"Ledger balance includes cheques that have been deposited but not yet "
"cleared. Available balance is the amount you can actually withdraw. Don’t"
" rely on the ledger balance as proof of funds."
msgstr "先看看應如何理解戶口結餘。登入網上或流動理財後，會見到兩個不同的結餘金額"

#: frontend/templates/cheque-fraud.html:22
msgid "How do cheque scams work?"
msgstr "「彈票黨」出沒注意！"

#: frontend/templates/cheque-fraud.html:23
msgid ""
"Scammers deposit invalid cheques, making it look like you’ve been paid. "
"They exploit the time it takes for cheques to clear, convincing victims "
"to deliver goods or send money before the cheque bounces."
msgstr "「彈票黨」騙徒會存入無效支票，令受害人誤以為自己已經收妥款項"

#: frontend/templates/cheque-fraud.html:26
msgid "Common techniques used by scammers"
msgstr "「彈票黨」常用技倆"

#: frontend/templates/cheque-fraud.html:28
msgid "Targeting sellers on social media or trading platforms with fake payments."
msgstr "騙徒通常在社交媒體或買賣交易平台出沒，假扮成買家，用無效支票購買貴價貨品。"

#: frontend/templates/cheque-fraud.html:29
msgid ""
"Depositing large sums with invalid cheques and asking for a refund of the"
" difference."
msgstr "有些騙徒會用無效支票假裝存入大量金額，然後要求受害人發回差額，令受害人不止被騙去貨物，更付出真金白銀退款，遭受雙重損失。"

#: frontend/templates/cheque-fraud.html:30
msgid "Using counterfeit cashier’s orders, which also take time to clear."
msgstr "部分騙徒以高佣金為餌，誘騙受害人向假供應商入貨。"

#: frontend/templates/cheque-fraud.html:31
msgid ""
"Impersonating teachers or charities to trick companies into making "
"payments to fake suppliers."
msgstr "他們會假扮成學校教師或慈善團體以獲取信任，哄騙公司代他們向假供應商付款入貨。"

#: frontend/templates/cheque-fraud.html:35
msgid "How to spot and prevent cheque scams"
msgstr "提防支票騙案"

#: frontend/templates/cheque-fraud.html:37
msgid ""
"Always check your available balance, not just the deposit slip or ledger "
"balance."
msgstr "收款時緊記檢查清楚戶口可用結餘，不應單靠入數紙或賬面結餘作轉賬證明。"

#: frontend/templates/cheque-fraud.html:38
msgid ""
"Don’t rush to comply with payment requests, even if the potential gain is"
" high."
msgstr "而且，就算回報多高，都不應急於答應對方要求，或提前付款。"

#: frontend/templates/cheque-fraud.html:39
msgid ""
"Verify the identity of anyone claiming to be from an institution using "
"official contact info."
msgstr "如果接到自稱來自某組織或某機構的電話，應該仔細查核對方背景，用官方聯絡資訊或成員通訊錄驗證他們的身份。"

#: frontend/templates/cheque-fraud.html:40
msgid "Use tools like Scameter to assess suspicious numbers or accounts."
msgstr "如有懷疑，可使用「防騙視伏器」、「防騙視伏App」應用程式等防騙資源，評估可疑電話號碼、網址、支付賬戶等的風險。"

#: frontend/templates/cheque-fraud.html:42
msgid ""
"If you think you've been scammed, contact HSBC immediately at (852) 2233 "
"3000."
msgstr "滙豐致力保障您的財務安全。懷疑自己遭遇支票詐騙？請即聯絡我們"

